Public entries (`docs/development.md`). Review: `src/review/orchestrator/orchestratorRun.ts`, `src/review/publish/publishSummaryOnly.ts`, `src/review/publish/publishFindingBatch.ts`, `src/review/ci/analyzeCi.ts`. Workspace: `src/prWorkspace/index.ts` (`withPrRepositoryView`). Intake: `src/agentWork/intake/planner.ts` (pure) and `applier.ts` (Postgres plus pg-boss). Durable definitions: `src/agentWork/workDefinition.ts` imports typed execution builders from `src/agentWork/executors/`; `worker.ts` registers the closed table. Executors return closed `WorkCompletion` values; only `durableJob.ts` calls `recordWorkCompleted` after a winning completion/failure mark. Review profile snapshots keep their original executor interval. `src/agentWork/installationSurface.ts` alone mints tokens and creates raw surfaces for agent work and code-index builds. Verdict and CI rows: `src/agentWork/reviewVerdict.ts`, `src/agentWork/prHeadCiState.ts`. Web: `agentWorkWebLive` (`src/agentWork/runtime.ts`); worker: `agentWorkWorkerLive` (`worker.ts`). Features: `src/agent/{ask,description,verification,triage}/`. Inline placement lives in `src/review/placement/`; GitHub review error predicates come from `src/github/reviewErrors.ts`. Do not add a second entry for an area, a forwarding-only wrapper, or a new top-level `src/` directory without a row in that table.
